  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 29 October 2026 at 12:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nIn a prime Devonport position overlooking the playing fields and out towards North Head, this is the standout unit currently on the market.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1960s, this charming two-bedroom unit offers easy open-plan living, with French doors opening to a deck that stretches right across the front of the home - the perfect spot to sit back, relax and enjoy the outlook or a game of rugby. \r\n\r\nThere’s also the added convenience of an electric-door single garage, complete with extra storage space.\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat: a short walk across Vauxhall Sports Field and Devonport Domain to beautiful Torpedo Bay Beach and the Torpedo Bay Beach Café or Dulcie’s if you prefer; or an easy 5-10-minute stroll to Cheltenham Beach if a South-Westerly’s blowing. It’s also easy-walking distance from Devonport Village, the ferry and, in the opposite direction, the Vauxhall shops and cafés and Narrow Neck Beach.\r\n\r\nFor investors, this is a particularly appealing opportunity, with a lovely, long-standing tenant who would very much like to stay on. So, if you’re looking for a great unit, in a great location, with a great tenant already in place, this is definitely one not to miss.\r\n\r\nFor first-home buyers or those looking to downsize, there’s plenty to love here too. It’s easy, manageable living with everything you need close at hand.\r\n\r\nWith its fabulous position, wonderful outlook, easy living and fantastic lifestyle on offer, this unit deserves your attention.",
